 are always appended at the end, with no way to control the order between plugins. This can have an importance if you're passing user command line arguments (i.e. `--engine-arg -- --user-arg`), as anything after `--` will be ignored by the engine itself and treated as an user argument.\r\n\r\nHaving support for specifying user command line arguments in a way that isn't reliant on order (e.g. `+user-arg`) could help resolve this in the long run.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107671#pullrequestreview-3049018534","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107671","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107671#pullrequestreview-3049018534"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107671"}},"submitted_at":"2025-07-23T20:47:25Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3052386001,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6177bR","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107671#pullrequestrev